  "description": "The fathers of the Go and Do families promised each other when they were young that they would raise their families side by side and they did just so. Years later, their kids are now teenagers/young adult who have been with each other most of their lives and are childhood friends. This is the story of the kids, their friends, and the relationships that weave them together yet just might be changing too. \n\n*Note: chapter count includes 2 extra chapters.*",
